# DOUBLE: CPU DOUBLE nve-free: the states are identical; within {{.*}} nm of velocity Verlet
# DOUBLE: CPU DOUBLE v-rescale: the states are identical
# DOUBLE: CPU DOUBLE nose-hoover: the states are identical
# DOUBLE: CPU DOUBLE langevin: the states are identical; within {{.*}} nm of velocity Verlet
# DOUBLE: CPU DOUBLE langevin-free: the states are identical; within {{.*}} nm of velocity Verlet
# DOUBLE: CPU DOUBLE langevin-trotter: the states are identical; within {{.*}} nm of velocity Verlet
# DOUBLE: CPU DOUBLE langevin-trotter-first-order: the states are identical; within {{.*}} nm of velocity Verlet
# DOUBLE: CPU DOUBLE v-rescale-trotter: the states are identical; within {{.*}} nm of velocity Verlet
# DOUBLE: CPU DOUBLE v-rescale-trotter-first-order: the states are identical; within {{.*}} nm of velocity Verlet
# DOUBLE: CPU DOUBLE v-rescale-exact: the states are identical; within {{.*}} nm of velocity Verlet
# DOUBLE: CPU DOUBLE v-rescale-first-order: the states are identical; within {{.*}} nm of velocity Verlet
